[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11943.03, "timestamp": "03:19:03", "text": "分钟。但我迟到的原因是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11945.91, "timestamp": "03:19:05", "text": "因为，呃，主要是因为，比如我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11949.03, "timestamp": "03:19:09", "text": "我在想，是啊，你知道吗？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11952.07, "timestamp": "03:19:12", "text": "已经开始直播《霍格沃茨》了。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11957.19, "timestamp": "03:19:17", "text": "为什么我不把它当成我修好显卡那样做呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11959.349, "timestamp": "03:19:19", "text": "就像我以前那样正常地做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11961.03, "timestamp": "03:19:21", "text": "做。我不需要选择加入这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11964.87, "timestamp": "03:19:24", "text": "临时搭建，而且可能比较简陋，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11966.389, "timestamp": "03:19:26", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11968.55, "timestamp": "03:19:28", "text": "但谢天谢地，明天我就能拿到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11971.59, "timestamp": "03:19:31", "text": "完全修复。所以，我没办法解决这个问题。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11974.63, "timestamp": "03:19:34", "text": "呃，我没有，所以有一件事是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11979.11, "timestamp": "03:19:39", "text": "大约三年前或两年前回来的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11980.95, "timestamp": "03:19:40", "text": "一年前，当我试图清理的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11983.429, "timestamp": "03:19:43", "text": "我试着把风扇拆下来。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11986.15, "timestamp": "03:19:46", "text": "我显然用了一把大号螺丝刀，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11989.99, "timestamp": "03:19:49", "text": "菲利普斯呃有呃这是一个优势"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11992.469, "timestamp": "03:19:52", "text": "就像加号或星号之类的东西，但很温和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11995.03, "timestamp": "03:19:55", "text": "那种更大的螺丝刀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11998.71, "timestamp": "03:19:58", "text": "螺丝拧得有点儿歪了，但是"}]